  "description": "Write type-safe SQL in C#. CodeQuery expresses queries, schema, migrations and routines through the C# type system, so column and table references are compiler-checked and refactor-safe instead of being SQL strings. This is the core package — add a driver package (CodeQuery.Postgres, CodeQuery.Sqlite, CodeQuery.MySql or CodeQuery.Mssql) for your database.",
